        "nobel_worthiness": "BCR-ABL inhibition established a decisive paradigm for molecularly targeted cancer treatment and changed outcomes in chronic myeloid leukemia.",
        "attribution": "Lydon, Druker, and Sawyers make a coherent proposed group spanning inhibitor development, clinical proof, and disease-specific mechanistic advance.",
        "maturity": "The therapeutic principle has endured for decades and has been extended widely across oncology.",
