        "attribution": "Krainer and Bennett represent key mechanistic and therapeutic-development contributions to the successful antisense strategy.",
        "maturity": "Clinical benefit is well established and the result has validated RNA splicing modulation as a therapeutic approach.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Credit must distinguish the central antisense advance from the broader history of SMA gene discovery and clinical development."
